---
description: Review the surrounding code for readability improvements
alwaysApply: true
---

Before completing a task, review the surrounding codebase, not just the files you modified.

Look for opportunities to:

- simplify control flow
- improve naming
- remove duplication
- extract meaningful concepts
- improve component and module boundaries
- consolidate related logic into existing abstractions

If a small refactor outside the requested changes would make the affected area simpler or more consistent, perform it, provided it doesn't change behavior or significantly expand the scope of the task.